            <div class="mt-1 text-[12.5px] text-text-tertiary">${heart.sleep.nights} nights in 30 · ${heart.sleep.shortNights} under 7 h · a move toward the band is the improvement, not more sleep without limit</div>` : `<p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-text-tertiary">No night on file.</p>`}
